nd":52.32},{"word":"was","start":52.32,"end":52.56},{"word":"my","start":52.56,"end":52.72},{"word":"question,","start":52.72,"end":53.68},{"word":"and","start":53.68,"end":53.92},{"word":"he","start":53.92,"end":54.08},{"word":"answered:","start":54.08,"end":54.72}]},{"id":7,"speaker":"virgil","text":"Rarely does one of us make the journey I'm taking.\nIt's true that I came down here once before,\nconjured by that merciless sorceress Erictho,\nwho called shades back into their bodies.\nMy flesh had barely grown cold\nwhen she forced me to enter that wall\nto bring forth a spirit from Judas's circle—\nthe lowest place, the darkest,\nfarthest from the heaven that encircles all.\nI know the way well, so don't worry.\nThis marsh that breathes such a foul stench\nsurrounds the city of sorrow,\nwhere we cannot enter now without violence.","startTime":54.72,"endTime":91.52,"words":[{"word":"Rarely","start":54.72,"end":55.28},{"word":"does","start":55.28,"end":55.52},{"word":"one","start":55.52,"end":55.68},{"word":"of","start":55.68,"end":55.84},{"word":"us","start":55.84,"end":56},{"word":"make","start":56,"end":56.24},{"word":"the","start":56.24,"end":56.4},{"word":"journey","start":56.4,"end":56.76},{"word":"I'm","start":56.76,"end":57.2},{"word":"taking.","start":57.2,"end":58.16},{"word":"It's","start":58.16,"end":58.48},{"word":"true","start":58.48,"end":58.68},{"word":"that","start":58.68,"end":58.8},{"word":"I","start":58.8,"end":59.08},{"word":"came","start":59.08,"end":59.28},{"word":"down","start":59.28,"end":59.52},{"word":"here","start":59.52,"end":59.76},{"word":"once","start":59.76,"end":60},{"word":"before,","start":60,"end":61.04},{"word":"conjured","start":61.04,"end":61.6},{"word":"by","start":61.6,"end":61.76},{"word":"that","start":61.76,"end":62.08},{"word":"merciless","start":62.08,"end":62.64},{"word":"sorceress","start":62.64,"end":63.36},{"word":"Erictho,","start":63.36,"end":64.32},{"word":"who","start":64.32,"end":64.56},{"word":"called","start