mud,\nI saw more than a thousand ruined souls\nfleeing before one who walked on foot\nacross the Styx with dry soles.\nHe fanned away that thick air from his face,\noften waving his left hand before him,\nand seemed weary only from this annoyance.\nI could tell he was sent from Heaven,\nand I turned to my Master, who signaled\nthat I should stand quietly and bow.\nHow full of scorn he appeared to me!\nHe reached the gate and with a small rod\nopened it—there was no resistance.","startTime":163.04,"endTime":235.44,"words":[{"word":"O","start":163.121,"end":163.521},{"word":"you","start":163.521,"end":163.841},{"word":"who","start":163.841,"end":164.001},{"word":"have","start":164.001,"end":164.321},{"word":"clear","start":164.321,"end":164.721},{"word":"understanding,","start":164.721,"end":166.001},{"word":"observe","start":166.001,"end":166.561},{"word":"the","start":166.561,"end":166.681},{"word":"teaching","start":166.681,"end":167.161},{"word":"that","start":167.161,"end":167.361},{"word":"hides","start":167.361,"end":167.681},{"word":"itself","start":167.681,"end":168.134},{"word":"beneath","start":168.134,"end":168.521},{"word":"the","start":168.521,"end":168.721},{"word":"veil","start":168.721,"end":169.041},{"word":"of","start":169.041,"end":169.201},{"word":"these","start":169.201,"end":169.361},{"word":"mysterious","start":169.361,"end":170.241},{"word":"verses!","start":170.241,"end":171.361},{"word":"Now","start":171.361,"end":171.761},{"word":"across","start":171.761,"end":172.161},{"word":"the","start":172.161,"end":172.321},{"word":"murky","start":172.321,"end":172.721},{"word":"waves","start":172.721,"end":173.201},{"word":"came","start":173.201,"end":173.361},{"word":"the","start":173.361,"end":173.601},{"word":"crash","start":173.601,"end":173.961},{"word":"of","start":173.961,"end":174.241},{"word":"a","start":174.241,"end":174.401},{"word":"terrifying","start":174.401,"end":175.121},{"word":"sound","start":175.121,"end":175.361},{"word":"that","s